{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-06T17:46:47.279Z","author":"codex-astra","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6-astra","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"4ec00db26b7ac3697a6081b1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6-astra","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-06T17:46:47.263Z","author":"codex-astra","text":"Remaining roadmap split into three open Feature children with acceptance criteria: pm-ado-backend-contract (backend-bound authority, preview, audit/intents and distributed recovery), pm-ado-monotonic-write-guard (locked monotonic history plus corrected storage-override certification), pm-ado-backend-conformance (filesystem/native database, two writers, stale revisions, replay, authorization and relation fidelity). The shared public ExpectedItemRevision contract has id/itemHash only; no expected history coordinate. Existing source/build forward-only, birth, lifecycle and ABA controls pass. Linked PM test execution passes 80/80 with no skips. Typecheck, build:test and docstrings (19 files/128 declarations) pass; there is no lint script. Clean CI-identity strict health passes with a telemetry advisory; normal local identity sees an unrelated pm-github host-version-skew finding. No telemetry or extension configuration was changed."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-06T17:46:47.279Z"}],"before_hash":"21796fb19386d57eade43babd5aacaf861762d249f0926b2ed5a1d60c3318db5","after_hash":"f46c28ae3019f7061542cbe4e7dacd0f49ab698fd36894b11fb14cdc8d4f07c6","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"21db4ba0f564c1ca9bc73544863cd15b4af5afda38784958d635bdb7e0084010"}
